      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm seeing some noise in the press about troop movements near the border. It's adding a lot of unnecessary pressure to the upcoming summit. Give me a straight assessment—is there any actual, credible evidence of an imminent escalation, or is this just political posturing and rumors? I need to know if I'm dealing with a real threat or just noise I can dismiss.",
